  "description": "MONDIAL: One frame to do it all.\nDesigned in Montréal by Atelier Olympia, the MONDIAL frame is built from butted steel and modern standards to create a durable, versatile platform. It can be built as a full steel touring or commuting bike, or configured with a carbon fork for a lighter, faster gravel setup. One frame, multiple lives.\n\nDesign principles\nDurability first\nButted steel for strength, repairability, and long service life.\nModern standards\nCompatibility with current and future components.\nMaximum adaptability\nMounts, clearance, and geometry designed to evolve.\nAccessible by design\nNo proprietary parts, no dead-end standards.",
